{"language":"kr","values":[["/names/cn","塔琳"],["/names/kr","탈렌"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名端庄典雅的法师，擅长消耗生命值作战，并能无限复活。"],["/description_i18n/kr","단정하고 우아한 마법사로 전투 시 HP를 소모하고 끝도 없이 부활한다."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让战场晴朗一些吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/kr","전장을 더욱 밝게 비추겠어요!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","每次燃烧都让我更加耀眼。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/kr","불탈 때마다 저는 더욱 빛날 테니까요."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","沐浴吧，圣焰的洗礼！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/kr","성염의 세례로 뒤덮여라!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我将浴火重生。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/kr","저는 불에서 부활할 겁니다."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利如阳光般闪耀。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/kr","승리는 태양처럼 빛나는군요."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","阳光是我的翅膀，烈焰是我的羽毛。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/kr","빛은 나의 날개요, 맹렬한 불길은 나의 깃털입니다."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","真是个好天气，要让它更好一些吗？交给我吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/kr","날씨 좋다. 좀 더 좋게 해드릴까요? 맡겨주시죠."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/kr","stt"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","今天天气晴朗啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/kr","오늘은 날씨가 좋네요."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/kr","stt"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","心情不好，要一起晒晒太阳吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/kr","기분이 안 좋으신가요? 함께 햇볕이라도 쬐시겠어요?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/kr","stt"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊，神圣又纯净的气息！我很喜欢，谢谢你的馈赠。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/kr","이렇게 신성할 수가! 너무 좋아요! 선물 고맙습니다."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢，我会善加收藏的。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/kr","고맙습니다. 소중히 간직할게요."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","……这种邪恶的东西，需要我净化它吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/kr","...이게 제가 정화해야 할 것인가요?"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","圣焰之翼"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/kr","성염의 날개"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","只要阳光还在照耀，她的羽毛就永远明艳。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/kr","태양빛이 비추는 한 깃털은 영원히 찬란할 것이다."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","焰海潮生"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/kr","불꽃 바다의 파도"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","炽烈的火焰分开潮水，她于浪潮间重获新生。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/kr","불꽃이 파도를 가른 사이에서 다시 태어난다."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","庆典甄礼活动获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/kr","축제 기념 선물 이벤트"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/kr","에픽"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","谁想晒晒太阳？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","햇볕 쬐고 싶은 사람 없어?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喜欢我的羽毛吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/kr","내 깃털이 마음에 들어?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","꿀! 딸기! 좋아해!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下雪了，太棒了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","눈이 내리네요, 멋져요!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/kr","꿀! 딸기! 좋아해!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我来点燃壁炉"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","벽난로에 불을 피울게요."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","鲜艳，温暖，完美"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","선명하고, 따스하고, 완벽해요"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","请看我的火焰吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/kr","제 불꽃을 보세요"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","听说，塔琳如果一段时间照不到太阳，不仅人会垂头丧气的，连羽毛都会褪色。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/kr","탈렌은 한동안 햇볕을 쬐지 못하면 의기소침해지며 깃털마저 퇴색되었다고 한다."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","塔琳最喜欢的“温泉浴场”是某处活火山的火山口——那里总是翻涌着灼热的岩浆。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/kr","탈렌이 가장 좋아하는 “온천”은 활화산의 분화구에 있으며, 그곳은 언제나 뜨거운 용암이 들끓고 있다."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","像是大部分羽毛美丽的鸟儿一样，闲来无事时，塔琳也会独自唱歌起舞。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/kr","깃털이 아름다운 새들처럼 한가할 때면 탈렌은 혼자 노래를 부르고 춤을 춘다."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","塔琳喜欢鲜艳和闪亮的东西——但她往往会克制自己的偏爱，保持优雅的姿态。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/kr","탈렌은 화려하면서도 반짝이는 것을 좋아하지만, 스스로 자제하며 우아한 자태를 유지하려고 한다."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","塔琳偶尔会把自己的羽毛赠送给中意的人，在必要时，它会化为庇护的火焰。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/kr","가끔 탈렌은 자신의 깃털을 마음에 드는 사람에게 선물하는데, 그 깃털은 특정 상황에서 그 사람을 지켜주는 불꽃으로 변신한다."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","塔琳非常，非常，非常讨厌下雨，但她深知雨水对农耕的重要性，所以每逢雨季，她都会努力忍耐。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/kr","탈렌은 비 오는 걸 매우 싫어하지만, 비가 농사를 짓는데 얼마나 중요한지 알고 있기에 우기가 되면 참으려고 애를 쓴다."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","塔琳最喜欢的工作就是在有洪涝危机时，帮忙驱散多余的雨云。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/kr","탈렌은 홍수 위기가 있을 때 비구름을 없애는 걸 가장 좋아한다."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“我曾经听过各个种族的歌唱与乐曲，但没有什么能比得过塔琳殿下随口哼唱的小调。”——某位年过古稀的知名音乐家如此评价。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/kr","“다양한 종족의 노래와 음악을 들어봤지만 탈렌이 흥얼거리는 노랫소리보다 좋은 것은 없었다.”——고희를 넘긴 저명한 음악가가 이렇게 평가했다."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","许多年前，塔琳唱歌的时候，会从四面八方吸引来许多鸟儿盘旋起舞，为她和声，那景象曾让无数人为之驻足。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/kr","오래전 탈렌이 노래를 부르면 사방에서 새들이 날아와 빙글빙글 돌며 화음을 넣었다. 그 광경은 많은 이들의 발길을 사로잡았었다."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","作为半神，塔琳无所畏惧——但偏好仍然存在，她喜欢干燥又高温的地方，对于海洋和冰雪则是敬谢不敏。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/kr","반신인 탈렌은 두려운 게 없었다. 하지만 취향이 확고해서 건조하면서도 고온인 곳을 좋아했고, 바다나 얼음이 가득한 곳은 정중히 거절했다."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/kr","아, 샤키탈리스! 또 여기서 게으름을 피우고 있군!"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415032.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","塔琳 & 萨基塔里斯"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/kr","탈렌 & 샤키탈리스"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","谁想晒晒太阳？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/kr","햇볕 쬐고 싶은 사람 없어?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415146.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415146.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","蜂蜜！草莓！我喜欢！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/kr","꿀! 딸기! 좋아해!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415147.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415147.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","看，这里完全变了个模样！充满了隆冬节的氛围！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/kr","봐, 여긴 완전히 달라졌군! 한겨울 축제 분위기로 가득해!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415346.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/kr","샤키탈리스 & 탈렌"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","下雪了，太棒了！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/kr","눈이 내리네요, 멋져요!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415463.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415463.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","我来点燃壁炉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/kr","벽난로에 불을 피울게요."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415464.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415464.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/kr","거참, 온도가 마음에 들지 않는군."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415484.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415484.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","蒂斯妮娅 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/kr","티스니아 & 탈렌"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","鲜艳，温暖，完美"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/kr","선명하고, 따스하고, 완벽해요"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415641.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415641.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","请看我的火焰吧"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/kr","제 불꽃을 보세요"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415642.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415642.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","塔琳"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/kr","탈렌"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","你、你的羽毛……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/kr","기, 깃털이..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415764.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/kr","locales/kr/mn/herohub_story/10415764.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","卡兹姆 & 塔琳"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/kr","카짐 & 탈렌"]]}